; M200 — lower the dust hood.
; Remapped in biber3ax.ini: REMAP = M200 modalgroup=10 ngc=m200
; Pulses motion.digital-out-01 (M64/M65 P1) onto the set pin of the
; dust-hood flipflop in io.hal, which holds the hood position and drives the
; solenoids (io-dout3.dout-3 down, dout-2 up). A pulse rather than a level so
; the PyVCP toggle button keeps working after this. M201 does the opposite.

o<m200> sub
  M64 P1
  G4 P0.05
  M65 P1
o<m200> endsub
M2
